'''Fallen Bear''' (アックマ閣下, ''Akkuma Kakka'', '''His Excellency Akkuma''') is an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] variant of [[Teacher Bear]] that appears in [[The Aku Realms]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

