==Trivia==
*His Japanese name, Akkuma Kakka (アックマ閣下, "His Excellency Akkuma"), combines the Japanese name of the [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] trait (悪魔 ''Akuma'', which means "Devil") with the word for bear (熊 ''kuma'').
**It may also be a reference to the Japanese musician, songwriter, entertainer, journalist, sumo commentator, actor and voice actor [[wikipedia:Demon Kakka|Demon Kakka]]. This is supported by how his Japanese description mentions sumo wrestling and how it's specifically his head that is engulfed in darkness, which is similar to how Demon Kakka always wears face paint. And much like what was given in [[Teacher Bear]]'s pre-[[Version 14.7 Update|14.7]] English description, Demon Kakka's real name is not known to the general public.
***Fallen Bear also appears in the stage [[Century's End (Merciless)|Century's End]], whose name heavily references the band [[wikipedia:Seikima-II|Seikima-II]] led by Demon Kakka.
*Fallen Bear may be based on the [https://yokai.com/onikuma/ onikuma], a strong-armed, bipedal bear ''[[wikipedia:Yōkai|yōkai]]'' whose name can be translated as "demon bear".
*The [[wikia:prowrestling:Atomic Drop|atomic drop]] is a professional wrestling move in which the wrestler goes behind an opponent, then puts their head under the opponent's shoulder. They then lift their opponent up, and drop them tailbone-first on the wrestler's knee.
*The made-up ''[[wikipedia:Kimarite|kimarite]]'' (sumo finishing move) in his Japanese description, akumadashinage (悪魔出し投げ, "pulling devil throw"), is a pun on the moves ''shitatedashinage'' (下手出し投げ, "pulling overarm throw") and ''uwatedashinage'' (上手出し投げ, "pulling underarm throw").
*According to [[Ancient Egg: N006 (Special Cat)|Fallen Bear Cat]]'s description, Fallen Bear has his own horror movie, titled House of the Fallen Bear.
**The Japanese name of House of the Fallen Bear, Akkuma no Sumu Ie (アックマの棲む家, "The House in Which Akkuma Dwells"), is a pun on ''Akuma no Sumu Ie'' (悪魔の棲む家, "The House in Which Devils Dwell"), the Japanese name of the horror movie ''[[wikipedia:The Amityville Horror (1979 film)|The Amityville Horror]]''.
*He is currently the only Aku enemy to have both [[Surge Attack#Death Surge|Death Surge]] and Shield abilities.
*He, [[Sinner Snache]], [[Condemned Peng]], [[Le'Behemoth]], and [[Wicked Face]] were added to the game files in [[Version 10.8 Update|Version 10.8]], but were unimplemented and used [[Doge]]'s stats and sprites as placeholders until [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

